# ── Personal career data must NEVER be committed ──────────────────────────
# This repo is public. A résumé pushed here is public forever, including in
# git history after deletion. The plugin writes user data into career/ —
# keep every form of it out.
career/
**/career/
*profile.md
*source-resume*
*claims.json
*104-application.md
*evidence-map.md
*gaps.md
*.pdf
*.docx
*.doc

# ── Everything else ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
*.plugin
.venv/
node_modules/
